# Phase WN1 -- the why-not explanation kernel

## 1. Status

**Draft r2, blocked.** Implementable once the owner approves plan r2 and rules
WN-D2, WN-D6, WN-D7, WN-D9 and WN-D10 (plan §10); WN-D3 is adopted `(p1)` and
confirmed at the gate. These change the algorithm, the module path, the limits
class and the payload fields below. No implementation has started.

